prop magazinelock on.use=message||Four keys, four turns. The magazine door swings in on cold, dry air and the smell of powder.\nopen|magazinedoor\nsound||event:/exploring/boxes/safe_unlock
prop magazinelock else.use=message||A lock with four keyholes, one for each bastion's commander.
