prop greatgun on.use=message||Powder, wad, shot, rammed home. You touch the fuse and step back - the great gun BOOMS over the whole island and its smoke rolls down over the walls. From far below, at the foot of the ramp, an answer: a roar.\nsound||event:/weapons/dynamite/explode\nshow|gatefight\nshow|leader\nshow|leadermusic\nwait|2\nsound||event:/wildlife/bear/bear_roar
prop greatgun else.use=message||The great gun, empty. The gunner's chart says: three kegs and a shot.
