quest title=Hold the Fort
quest intro=A star fort on a desert table-land, besieged by the island's beasts. The governor's last order is nailed to the gate.
# Chapter 1 - the gate
step reach|ramp|1|Land and walk to the foot of the ramp road
step read|The governor's last order|1|Climb to the gate and read the governor's last order
step collect|story:gatekey|1|Take the gate key from the guardhouse at the ramp's foot
step reach|parade|1|Unlock the gate and march onto the parade ground
step kill|Hyena|4|Hold off the first wave from the north bastion
# Chapter 2 - the bastions
step reach|northbastion|1|Climb to the north bastion
step open|North commander's locker|1|Open the north commander's locker
step reach|eastbastion|1|Climb to the east bastion
step kill|Warthog|4|Hold off the second wave
step open|East commander's locker|1|Open the east commander's locker
step reach|westbastion|1|Climb to the west bastion
step kill|Screecher|3|Hold off the third wave
step open|West commander's locker|1|Open the west commander's locker
step reach|southbastion|1|Climb to the south bastion over the sea
step kill|Roach|4|Hold off the scarabs from the sea caves
step open|South commander's locker|1|Open the south commander's locker
# Chapter 3 - the magazine
step reach|magazine|1|Turn the four bastion keys and enter the magazine under the keep
step read|The master gunner's chart|1|Read the master gunner's chart
step collect|story:powder|3|Take the three kegs of dry powder (one in the flooded sea-cave store)
step collect|story:shot|1|Take a shot for the great gun
# Chapter 4 - the last stand
step reach|keeptop|1|Climb to the great gun on the keep's roof
step reach|gatefight|1|Fire the great gun - and run down to the gate
step kill|Mama bear|1|Stand at the gate against the pack's leader
step read|The governor's journal|1|Read the governor's journal in her study
step open|The governor's chest|1|Open the governor's chest
quest done=The siege of the beasts is over for another season. Fort Meridian held - by one defender. When you go, leave the gate open.
quest reward=TitaniumIngot*2;MetalIngot*4;Cooked_GenericMeat*3

save Star Fort
